Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:16.12,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,That's two of the three ingredients \NI need for the Elixir of Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:18.58,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Just one to go:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:21.69,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,the purified blood of the demon monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:24.54,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,When I go for it, \NI'll need to be fully prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:28.76,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I've leveled up a fair bit from \Nvisiting the Demon's Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:32.42,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,But officially, I'm still E-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:34.48,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I might want to get stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:37.59,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,but I won't be able to participate \Nin higher-level raids with that rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:42.65,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I need to stop faking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:45.23,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,And it's not like the truth \Ncan stay secret forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.49,0:00:49.04,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get my hunter rank reassessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:30.42,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,The line for hunter rank \Nassessment is over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:34.38,DefaultItalics,Hyun Kichul,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what kind of personnel \Nwe'll be able to recruit today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:39.13,DefaultItalics,Hyun Kichul,0000,0000,0000,,He looks like a C-Rank. \NThat one is a pretty obvious E-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:40.91,DefaultItalics,Hyun Kichul,0000,0000,0000,,Beyond that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:45.85,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, this is Baek Yoonho.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.91,DefaultItalics,Hyun Kichul,0000,0000,0000,,This is Hyun Kichul from the \NSecond Administration Team!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:49.14,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:50.48,DefaultItalics,Hyun Kichul,0000,0000,0000,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:52.28,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,Say that again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.28,0:02:54.29,Default,Hyun Kichul,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.29,0:02:57.60,Default,Hyun Kichul,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Sung is here to have \Nhis rank reassessed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.60,0:02:59.49,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,Right this way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:00.24,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:02.24,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,I'm heading there right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.01,0:03:06.21,Default,Testee A,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to be nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:10.03,Default,Testee A,0000,0000,0000,,The actual assessment is pretty simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:14.76,Default,Testee B,0000,0000,0000,,I need to get my hunter rank \Nsorted out so I can earn money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.76,0:03:17.60,Default,Testee B,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe then, my ex-wife and \Ndaughter will come back...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:19.14,Default,Testee A,0000,0000,0000,,Look there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.75,0:03:25.35,Default,Testee A,0000,0000,0000,,If you get D-Rank or higher, \Nthe scouts from the guilds will talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:29.56,Default,Testee A,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. As long as you're not E-Rank, \Nyou can make a good living.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.70,0:03:33.52,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,"As long as you're not E-Rank," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:35.72,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.72,0:03:36.65,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.74,0:03:40.80,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,If I could get your name for confirmation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:42.16,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Sung Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:43.93,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,A reassessment, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:44.81,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:48.18,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,The process is the same as before,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:50.88,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,so please hold your hand against \Nthe black crystal and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:03:58.96,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.41,0:04:00.44,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,An error?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.08,0:04:02.65,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,Pardon me. Could you do it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.65,0:04:03.65,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:07.01,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,That's odd...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:10.50,Default,Jung Kisoo,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:11.53,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,Chief...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:16.52,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,Something's strange. I keep trying, \Nbut it's not able to evaluate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:19.24,Default,Jung Kisoo,0000,0000,0000,,That can't be right. Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.66,0:04:22.76,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,See what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:25.41,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:27.75,Default,Jung Kisoo,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:30.25,Default,Jung Kisoo,0000,0000,0000,,It's saying he {\i1}can't{\i0} be assessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:32.20,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.20,0:04:36.81,Default,Jung Kisoo,0000,0000,0000,,It means he's got more magic power \Nthan can be measured with this machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:39.24,Default,Associate A,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? That'd mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:42.18,Default,Jung Kisoo,0000,0000,0000,,Right. He's the tenth person \Never in the country...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:44.38,Default,Jung Kisoo,0000,0000,0000,,to be S-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.59,0:04:49.29,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Is there any news on the \Nwinged ants from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.74,0:04:52.39,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,The intel department's \Ncommenced their necropsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.39,0:04:55.77,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,They'll be comparing their biology and \Ntrace magic power levels with past examples
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:58.11,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,in order to see what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.53,0:05:02.00,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,The results will take a bit longer, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:03.32,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.32,0:05:06.27,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,So many strange things lately...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.27,0:05:08.70,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Like the red gate, for instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:13.09,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently an outsider who was participating \Nin the White Tiger Guild raid
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.09,0:05:15.85,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,ended up beating the dungeon boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.85,0:05:17.24,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Who exactly is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:22.96,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,I was present during the investigation, \Nbut not the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.72,0:05:25.28,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,So I don't have all the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:26.96,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:30.85,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, something seems to be \Ngoing on over by the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:35.19,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Most likely an awakened making a fuss \Nafter having been assessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.19,0:05:36.45,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.15,0:05:39.63,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,I'll join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:43.07,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,I'm curious about the commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:48.35,Default,Scout A,0000,0000,0000,,He couldn't be assessed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.35,0:05:51.46,Default,Scout B,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?! I wasn't sure that ever happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:52.83,Default,Scout C,0000,0000,0000,,Never seen anything like it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:56.11,DefaultTop,Jung Kisoo,0000,0000,0000,,Unfortunately, the standard equipment can't properly assess you, Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:56.11,Default,Scout D,0000,0000,0000,,Obviously! There's only been \Nnine hunters like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.11,0:05:59.76,DefaultTop,Jung Kisoo,0000,0000,0000,,Would you mind coming back in three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.11,0:05:59.80,Default,Scout E,0000,0000,0000,,Then this guy is the tenth \NS-Rank in the country?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.76,0:06:01.15,DefaultTop,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:05.72,DefaultItalics,Hyun Kichul,0000,0000,0000,,It's just like Manager Ahn said! \NI need to be the first one to talk to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:08.93,Default,Jung Kisoo,0000,0000,0000,,Once that's done, \Nyou'll get your updated license.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.61,0:06:11.01,Default,Jung Kisoo,0000,0000,0000,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:13.72,Default,Scout E,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:20.09,Default,Hyun Kichul,0000,0000,0000,,The head of the Hunters Guild, Choi Jong-in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.93,0:06:24.99,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,He who stands at the pinnacle of fire magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.99,0:06:27.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,the hunter known as the "ultimate weapon"...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:30.16,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,The counterpart to my old nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:34.82,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that explains the commotion, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:36.95,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:41.12,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Choi Jong-in, \Nand I represent the Hunters Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:43.51,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Have you decided on a guild yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:46.12,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to discuss it with you \Nif you're not busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.12,0:06:47.64,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I am, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:51.99,Default,Scout G,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.99,0:06:54.26,Default,Scout H,0000,0000,0000,,He just shot Guildmaster Choi down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.85,0:07:00.23,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Manager Woo, I did mention that I was Choi \NJong-in from the Hunters Guild, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:01.94,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'm certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:06.37,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,It seems I've grown conceited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.01,0:07:10.62,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Sung... Then it's really true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:14.10,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,And now he's gone without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.53,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he's an assassin type?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.61,0:07:20.08,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,President Baek...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:21.50,Default,Hyun Kichul,0000,0000,0000,,President!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:24.64,DefaultItalics,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,I see how it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:27.85,DefaultItalics,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,The White Tiger's office isn't far from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.24,0:07:26.34,DefaultTop,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,Where is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:30.43,DefaultTop,Hyun Kichul,0000,0000,0000,,He left as soon as he exited \Nthe the assessment room!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.85,0:07:30.43,DefaultItalics,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,but he ran hard enough to be short of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:32.60,DefaultTop,Hyun Kichul,0000,0000,0000,,I tried to call out to him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.07,0:07:34.72,DefaultItalics,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,That's how badly he wanted to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:39.69,DefaultItalics,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Jackpot. This must be the outsider \Nwho cleared the red gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.93,0:07:43.12,DefaultItalics,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,Jong-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:54.80,DefaultItalics,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,Of all the people to catch wind of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:06.13,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,She looks like she could \Nwake up at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.17,0:08:17.02,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Just a bit longer now, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:23.11,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,It seems my eyes have failed me all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:26.36,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,The surveillance team's job is to watch hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.98,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,and punish any who break the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:33.13,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,I'm usually confident about \Nmy judgment, but this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:35.43,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Do I need surveillance?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.43,0:08:37.37,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Not the same way that a criminal might.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.01,0:08:42.25,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,The surveillance team is the only group \Nable to handle hunter-related incidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:46.53,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,But when dealing with S-Ranks, \Neven we're powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.59,0:08:50.49,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,There's someone who'd like \Nto meet you, Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:01.06,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:05.01,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Go Gunhee, and I'm the \Nchairman of the Hunter's Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:10.28,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,First of all, congratulations \Non your S-Rank assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.56,0:09:14.74,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,The reassessment is but \Na formality at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.13,0:09:19.75,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,From the moment you're confirmed to be \Noff the charts, you're S-Rank by definition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.75,0:09:21.33,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Why bother, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:25.33,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,With the formal reassessment?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:28.05,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,It's something of a grace period.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.47,0:09:33.26,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,It allows us to make contact \Nwith individuals such as yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:38.62,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Sadly, despite our reach, the Association \Ndoes not have many skilled hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:43.48,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,We can't really compete with large guilds \Nin terms of pay or fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.93,0:09:49.96,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Manager Woo is one of our top-level hunters, \Nand even he's only A-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.55,0:09:52.73,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get to the point now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.85,0:09:57.49,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,I would be thrilled if you could join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.53,0:10:02.42,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,I can prepare a key position \Nin the Association for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.22,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Why go so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:08.48,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,The nation's greatest advocates right now \Nare not the government,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.48,0:10:11.80,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,but the hunters, who protect \Nthe people from magic beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:16.18,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,The core of which is the five largest guilds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:18.73,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,In a sense, it's like five great dinosaurs
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:21.99,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,maintaining a delicate stalemate \Nagainst each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:26.73,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,But should you join any of them, \Nthat balance will collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:32.40,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,The Hunter's Association is vital \Nto the nation as a deterrent to them—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:34.73,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,a sixth power, essentially.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:37.28,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,And that's why you want me to join?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:40.24,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,You certainly possess the strength for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:43.70,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Perhaps even one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:46.57,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.29,0:10:49.24,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,It's a good offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:54.05,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,A job inside of the Association \Nis basically a guaranteed career track.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.00,0:10:58.04,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I doubt there's anyone with \Ngreater reach than Chairman Go,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:01.30,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,especially with the press \Nand the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:07.61,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Plus, he's an amazing hunter. \NThe first S-Rank to awaken in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.97,0:11:09.83,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,He possesses overwhelming magic power
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:12.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,and a physique that's makes it \Nhard to believe he's over 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:18.53,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,He's retired, yet he's on even footing \Nwith me after all my efforts to level up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:24.76,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,If I accept his offer, my life will change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.54,0:11:27.12,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Hunter Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:32.82,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I have to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:37.42,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose it all comes down to money, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:40.26,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I want to fight, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:45.84,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,You mean against magic beasts?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.84,0:11:50.06,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Right. The dungeons are where I belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.63,0:11:55.76,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Incredible. I can tell from his eyes \Nthat he's not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:12:00.44,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,How many years has it been \Nsince I've felt this sensation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.09,0:12:04.91,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,I'm impressed my heart can still \Nmake these kinds of noises.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.91,0:12:10.62,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,If I were twenty—no, ten years younger, \NI could've stood aside someone like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:17.06,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Understood. I won't press the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:21.86,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,My sister is at home alone, \Nso I should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.73,0:12:26.27,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:33.40,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,I remember how crestfallen I was \Nwhen I aged past the point
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:36.02,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,that even an S-Rank healer \Ncouldn't offset my decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:41.29,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Cancel the rest of my schedule for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.29,0:12:44.04,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want anything to disrupt this feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.83,0:12:48.32,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Manager Woo, would you join me for a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.32,0:12:51.92,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,As long as you don't mind \Nthat I won't partake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.92,0:12:53.13,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:57.16,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if he likes to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:02.92,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,The Association mostly handles \ND and E-Rank dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.92,0:13:07.73,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I need to level up as soon as possible \Nso that I can heal Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:11.05,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.47,0:13:13.98,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Because I can keep growing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:38.80,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,Come to rub salt in my wounds, Deputy Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:41.72,Default,Deputy Chief,0000,0000,0000,,Just had questions \NI'd like to ask you in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.37,0:13:47.43,Default,Deputy Chief,0000,0000,0000,,This Il-hwan Sung. Is he really a magic beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.99,0:13:52.43,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,Did he seem like a human to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:56.86,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,He sure as hell seemed like a beast to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.73,0:14:01.83,Default,Deputy Chief,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Focus on your recovery, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:05.07,Default,Deputy Chief,0000,0000,0000,,Drop by the command center \Nonce you're discharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.23,0:14:07.41,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,Where is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:09.49,Default,Deputy Chief,0000,0000,0000,,The command center's tracking him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.49,0:14:14.49,Default,Deputy Chief,0000,0000,0000,,But I doubt they'll be able to bring in \Nsomeone who was able to beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:20.21,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.07,0:14:25.87,Flashback,Sung Il-hwan,0000,0000,0000,,You'd better stay away from my family. \NFor your own sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:29.76,Flashback,Sung Il-hwan,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't... even death \Nwon't save you from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:32.82,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,What a humiliating loss...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.82,0:14:37.23,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,Even death won't save me? \NIs that his idea of a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:42.19,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,I know where he's headed. \NNow I just need gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:45.91,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,An artifact that'll let me crush that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:51.73,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Artifacts: a word that usually \Nrefers to man-made relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.73,0:14:53.16,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,But in the world of hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.16,0:14:57.67,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,artifacts are high-level gear that even \Nexperienced craftsmen can't produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:15:00.33,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,With the increase in hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:03.18,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,you can find them in online auctions \Nlike anything else, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.13,0:15:06.79,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Do they have to be so expensive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.97,0:15:11.90,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I want my gear to be flawless before \NI take on the rest of the Demon's Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.90,0:15:15.10,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing in the store seemed a good fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:19.78,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,The Sphere of Avarice can be transferred. \NI should be able to sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.30,0:15:25.53,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Most of the best gear in circulation offers \Na 20-30% increase in performance,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.53,0:15:28.85,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,but this sphere can double magic damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:30.99,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,And that means it'll fetch a high price.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.69,0:15:35.38,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Which will raise the question: \Nhow does an E-Rank like me have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:38.12,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,People are bound to try and \Nfind out where it came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.81,0:15:42.29,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,If there was a record of me entering an \NA-Rank gate, that'd serve as an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:45.84,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,But I can't join a raid like that as an E-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:49.79,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, someone's actually recruiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.86,0:15:54.19,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,This is our data from four years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.19,0:15:57.35,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,His photo looks completely \Ndifferent. Like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.03,0:16:00.16,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Is there a chance he \Nfalsified his original rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.82,0:16:04.07,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,He's on the record as being \Nseverely injured several times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.59,0:16:06.37,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,That makes it unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.73,0:16:11.72,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,It's incredible that he held out \Nfor so long, after so many raids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.09,0:16:16.21,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Paying for his mother's Eternal Sleep \Ntreatment and his sister's tuition...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.21,0:16:18.79,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,He's been supporting his family \Nwith his income.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:22.83,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,You don't see that kind of devotion \Nfrom young folks these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:28.22,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,There's been a report that Hunter Sung \Nhas joined a Hunters Guild raid team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.27,0:16:34.70,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Then, in spite of what he said, he was \Nlured in by a lucrative signing bonus...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:39.19,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,From what the report says, \Nhe's joined a mining team of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.19,0:16:40.79,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,A mining team?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:41.40,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.75,0:16:47.59,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,He's certainly hard to predict, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.94,0:16:49.65,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,So, you're E-Rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:50.58,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.58,0:16:51.90,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,You do much excavation before?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.90,0:16:53.18,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,This is my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.18,0:16:57.49,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,Then you're a combat type? Shouldn't \Nhave to worry about your fitness, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:17:01.31,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,We've got plenty of folks like you, Mr. Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:03.79,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,Just relax, and let's work hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:04.96,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:09.42,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Major raids that take place in high-level \Ndungeons demand a degree of specialization.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.07,0:17:12.75,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,You have the strike team \Nthat deals with magic beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.75,0:17:16.18,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,the mining team that collects \Nthe mana crystals in the dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:19.14,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,and the collection team that \Nrecovers the beast carcasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:22.82,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,It's a lot of personnel, \Nbut the profits justify it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:25.98,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I bet right now, inside the dungeon...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:29.72,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Back up, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.72,0:17:32.77,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,They don't seem to appreciate the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.84,0:17:54.18,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Tanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:58.31,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,If you would, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.05,0:18:13.99,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,The carcasses aren't of much use \Nif they're cooked to well-done,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.99,0:18:15.91,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,so I tried to keep it at medium.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.65,0:18:20.04,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,I believe that takes care of most \Nof the nearby enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:21.71,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.34,0:18:26.54,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,I know one of us has a sensitive nose, \Nso do mind the smell of burning beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:30.13,Default,Worker A,0000,0000,0000,,The strike team's coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.07,0:18:33.84,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Then everything but the \Ndungeon boss is dead already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.29,0:18:37.83,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I could sense he was strong \Nduring our encounter yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.29,0:18:41.07,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,but for everyone to emerge from an \NA-Rank gate without a scratch...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.07,0:18:43.06,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,just goes to show how strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.06,0:18:46.52,Default,Worker B,0000,0000,0000,,And there's the Hunters Guild \Nsecond-in-command.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:50.57,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,That's her...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:56.53,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,The vice guild master of the Hunters Guild, \Nand the ninth S-Rank hunter in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.43,0:18:59.87,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Cha Hae-in, the Dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.07,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.94,0:19:06.90,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I have to wonder how many people \Nin the world have that much aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.99,0:19:14.09,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I just sensed \Nsomething incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.09,0:19:15.51,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Was I imagining it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.51,0:19:18.90,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,For a second, I thought \NChairman Go was around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:21.80,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,But now there's no trace of whoever it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.29,0:19:26.39,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,She's even sharper than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.39,0:19:29.19,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,All right, everyone! Let's get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.19,0:19:31.31,DefaultTop,BG,0000,0000,0000,,All righty...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.49,0:19:34.82,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,With the strike team's work finished, \Nit's the mining and collection teams' turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.31,0:19:34.00,DefaultTop,Workers,0000,0000,0000,,One... two...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.97,0:19:46.99,DefaultTop,Workers,0000,0000,0000,,One, two!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.35,0:19:40.53,Default,Workers,0000,0000,0000,,It's looking a little loose here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.61,0:19:48.71,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,There's a magic power signal \Ncoming from deeper in the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.67,0:19:53.00,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Must be the A-Rank dungeon boss giving it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:19:58.22,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,It's stronger than Vulcan and Metis \Nfrom the Demon's Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.11,0:20:04.99,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm tempted to find out for myself \Nhow strong an A-Rank boss really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.99,0:20:08.38,Default,Worker A,0000,0000,0000,,Did you hear? The guy who joined \Nfor this job is an E-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:10.06,Default,Worker B,0000,0000,0000,,E-Rank? Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:12.56,Default,Worker C,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell was the boss thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:17.93,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,No matter where you go, \NE-Ranks get the same treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.93,0:20:20.30,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Not that I intend on doing this for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:23.08,Default,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let's get a move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:25.90,Default,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,It's tight enough in here! \NYou can't just stand around—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:31.52,Default,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, well... P-Please take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.55,0:20:35.64,Default,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,Is that dude seriously E-Rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.41,0:20:41.60,Default,Mok Jinsoo,0000,0000,0000,,Chief... Is he really E-Rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:42.74,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.74,0:20:45.36,Default,Mok Jinsoo,0000,0000,0000,,He seems... super strong, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:51.02,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,I get the feeling Mr. Sung is God's gift \Nto blue-collars like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.35,0:20:55.35,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, break time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:57.15,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,Let's all go get something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:58.38,Default,Workers,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:21:00.58,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,You coming, Mr. Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.58,0:21:02.43,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to finish up here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.43,0:21:03.91,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.91,0:21:06.60,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,Don't go too far in, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.60,0:21:07.67,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.93,0:21:19.75,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm finally alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.75,0:21:22.32,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I can't let this chance slip by.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.32,0:21:26.16,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Break time lasts an hour... Let's take a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.37,0:21:32.44,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,This must be the boss chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:35.70,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Definitely seems stronger than Metis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:40.69,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I realize that I shouldn't defeat this boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.47,0:21:43.54,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,If I do, the gate closes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.27,0:21:47.15,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,at a huge loss to the Hunters Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.17,0:21:52.38,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Still... A little poke can't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.38,0:21:54.62,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:02.13,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,I'll ask again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.90,0:22:05.23,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think you're doing?
